LICH-006 Seed Corpus: State Machine

State machine events (bytes):
  0x01 Activate  0x02 Drain    0x03 Close
  0x04 Error     0x05 Reset    0x06 Goaway
  0x07 Cancel

Valid transition sequences:
  [01, 02, 03, 03]  -> idle -> active -> draining -> closing -> closed
  [01, 04, 05]      -> idle -> active -> error -> reset (back to idle)
  [01, 06]          -> idle -> active -> draining (via GOAWAY)

GOAWAY flow IDs are encoded as big-endian uint32 (4 bytes each).
